{"name_en": "Adamantius (Melitian bishop)", "zh": "阿達曼", "sei": "阿", "mei": "達曼", "zh_full": "阿達曼提烏斯", "sex": "m", "years": [335, 335], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "梅勒提烏派", "role": "宗教", "place": "埃及", "lat": 30.0, "lon": 31.2, "offices": ["主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia"], "foes": ["Athanasius of Alexandria"], "bio": "主教。優西比烏一黨向君士坦丁誣告亞他那修揚言阻斷亞歷山大運往君士坦丁堡之糧，以阿達曼提烏斯等四主教為證，皇帝遂流放亞他那修於高盧。", "stats": [10, 10, 40, 35, 30], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Socrates 1.35"}
