{"name_en": "Arbathion", "zh": "阿巴提", "sei": "阿", "mei": "巴提", "zh_full": "阿爾巴提翁", "sex": "m", "years": [335, 335], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "梅勒提烏派", "role": "宗教", "place": "埃及", "lat": 30.0, "lon": 31.2, "offices": ["主教"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Eusebius of Nicomedia"], "foes": ["Athanasius of Alexandria"], "bio": "主教。優西比烏一黨誣告亞他那修欲阻斷京師糧運，阿爾巴提翁列名證人，君士坦丁信之，將亞他那修流放特里爾。", "stats": [10, 10, 40, 35, 30], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Socrates 1.35"}
